LangString webview2AbortError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Unable to install WebView2! The app cannot run without it.$\r$\n$\r$\nIf the download failed, download and install the WebView2 Runtime manually, then run this installer again. For how, see wherever you got this installer, or the FAQ at https://github.com/S0u1/silly-cat.$\r$\n$\r$\nThe installer tried to save 捣蛋猫-安装日志.txt to your desktop. Please send it to wherever you got this installer (for example, the group chat), or attach it to a report at https://github.com/S0u1/silly-cat/issues."
